 is forbidden to meet the caravans on the way (to buy the goods away from the market)\nL59: \nL60: (71)\nL61: \nL62: باب النَّهْىِ عَنْ تَلَقِّي الرُّكْبَان\nL63: \nL64: Sahih al-Bukhari 2165\nL65: \nL66: Narrated `Abdullah bin `Umar:\nL67: \nL68: Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"You should not try to cancel the purchases of one another (to get a benefit thereof), and do not go ahead to meet the caravan (for buying the goods) (but wait) till it reaches the market.\"\nL69: حَدَّثَنَا 【10†عَبْدُ اللَّهِ بْنُ يُوسُفَ】، أَخْبَرَنَا 【11†مَالِكٌ】، عَنْ 【12†نَافِعٍ】، عَنْ 【13†عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ عُمَرَ】 ـ رضى الله عنهما ـ أَنَّ رَسُولَ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم قَالَ ‏\"‏ لاَ يَبِيعُ بَعْضُكُمْ عَلَى بَيْعِ بَعْضٍ، وَلاَ تَلَقَّوُا السِّلَعَ حَتَّى يُهْبَطَ بِهَا إِلَى السُّوقِ ‏\"‏‏.‏\nL70: \nL71: Reference  |  : 【14†Sahih al-Bukhari 2165】\nL72: In-book reference  |  : Book 34, Hadith 116\nL73: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Vol. 3, Book 34, Hadith 374\nL74:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih al-Bukhari 2270 - Hiring - كتاب الإجارة - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/bukhari%3A2270)\nciteturn26view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:2270\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/bukhari:2270; Total lines: 82\nL0: Contribute to our mission 【0†Donate Now】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Qur'an†quran.com】 | 【2†Sunnah】 | 【3†Prayer Times†salah.com】 | 【4†Audio†quranicaudio.com】\nL3: \nL4: 【5†Image: toggle Light Thme】 【6†Image: toggle Dark Thme】\nL5: \nL6: [Input: Search …] [Input]\nL7: ## Select Collections\nL8: \nL9: Sahih al-Bukhari\nL10: \nL11: Sahih Muslim\nL12: \nL13: Sunan an-Nasa'i\nL14: \nL15: Sunan Abi Dawud\nL16: \nL17: Jami` at-Tirmidhi\nL18: \nL19: Sunan Ibn Majah\nL20: \nL21: Show More Collections\nL22: \nL23: [Button: Apply]\nL24: \nL25