ْهُ وَلَمْ يُعْطِهِ أَجْرَهُ ‏\"‏‏.‏\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih al-Bukhari 2400 - Loans, Payment of Loans, Freezing of Property, Bankruptcy - كتاب فى الاستقراض - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/bukhari%3A2400)\nciteturn26view4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:2400\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/bukhari:2400; Total lines: 82\nL0: Contribute to our mission 【0†Donate Now】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Qur'an†quran.com】 | 【2†Sunnah】 | 【3†Prayer Times†salah.com】 | 【4†Audio†quranicaudio.com】\nL3: \nL4: 【5†Image: toggle Light Thme】 【6†Image: toggle Dark Thme】\nL5: \nL6: [Input: Search …] [Input]\nL7: ## Select Collections\nL8: \nL9: Sahih al-Bukhari\nL10: \nL11: Sahih Muslim\nL12: \nL13: Sunan an-Nasa'i\nL14: \nL15: Sunan Abi Dawud\nL16: \nL17: Jami` at-Tirmidhi\nL18: \nL19: Sunan Ibn Majah\nL20: \nL21: Show More Collections\nL22: \nL23: [Button: Apply]\nL24: \nL25: Quotes e.g. \"pledge allegiance\"\nL26: Searches for the whole phrase instead of individual words\nL27: \nL28: Wildcards e.g. test*\nL29: Matches any set of one or more characters. For example test* would result in test, tester, testers, etc.\nL30: \nL31: Fuzzy Search e.g. swore~\nL32: Finds terms that are similar in spelling. For example swore~ would result in swore, snore, score, etc.\nL33: Term Boosting e.g. pledge^4 hijrah\nL34: Boosts words with higher relevance. Here, the word pledge will have higher weight than hijrah\nL35: \nL36: Boolean Operators e.g. (\"pledge allegiance\" OR \"shelter) AND prayer\nL37: Create complex phrase and word queries by using Boolean logic.\nL38: \nL39: 【7†More ...】\nL40: \nL41: 【2†Home】 » 【8†Sahih al-Bukhari】 » 【9†Loans, Payment of Loans, Freezing of Property, Bankruptcy - كتاب فى الاستقراض】 » Hadith 2400\nL42: \nL43: Language:\nL44: \nL45: [Input] English\nL46: \nL47: [Input] Urdu  اردو\nL48: \nL49: [Input] Bangla  বাংলা\nL50: \nL51: كتاب فى الاستقراض\nL52: \nL53: 43\nL54: Loans, Payment of Loans, Freezing of Property, Bankruptcy\nL55: \nL56: (12)\nL57: \nL58: Chapter: Procrastination (delay) in repaying debts by a wealthy person is injustice\nL59: \nL60: (12)\nL61: \nL62: باب مَطْلُ الْغَنِيِّ ظُلْمٌ\nL63: \nL64: Sahih al-Bukhari 2400\nL65: \nL66: Narrated Abu Huraira:\nL67: \nL68: Allah's Messenger (ﷺ) said, \"Procrastination (delay) in repaying debts by a wealthy person is injustice.\"\nL69: حَدَّثَنَا 【10†مُسَدَّدٌ】، حَدَّثَنَا 【11†عَبْدُ الأَعْلَى】، عَنْ 【12†مَعْمَرٍ】، عَنْ 【13†هَمَّامِ بْنِ مُنَبِّهٍ】، أَخِي وَهْبِ بْنِ مُنَبِّهٍ أَنَّهُ سَمِعَ 【14†أَبَا هُرَيْرَةَ】 ـ رضى الله عنه ـ يَقُولُ قَالَ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ صلى الله عليه وسلم ‏\"‏ مَطْلُ الْغَنِيِّ ظُلْمٌ ‏\"‏‏.‏\nL70: \nL71: Reference  |  : 【15†Sahih al-Bukhari 2400】\nL72: In-book reference  |  : Book 43, Hadith 16\nL73: USC-MSA web (English) reference  |  : Vol. 3, Book 41, Hadith 585\nL74:   (deprecated numbering scheme)\nL75: \nL76: Report Error | Share | Copy ▼\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSahih al-Bukhari 2387 - Loans, Payment of Loans, Freezing of Property, Bankruptcy - كتاب فى الاستقراض - Sunnah.com - Sayings and Teachings of Prophet Muhammad (صلى الله عليه و سلم) (https://sunnah.com/bukhari%3A2387)\nciteturn26view5 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://sunnah.com/bukhari:2387\",\"lineno\":null}); Redirected to URL: https://sunnah.com/bukhari:2387; Total lines: 82\nL0: Contribute to our mission 【0†Donate Now】\nL1: \nL2: 【1†Qur'an†quran.com】 | 【2†Sunnah】 | 【3†Prayer Times†salah.com】 | 【4†Audio†quranicaudio.com】\nL3: \nL4: 【5†Image: toggle Light Thme】 【6†Image: toggle Dark Thme】\nL5: \nL6: [Input: Search …] [Input]\nL7: ## Select Collections\nL8: \nL9: Sahih al-Bukhari\nL10: \nL11: Sahih Muslim\nL12: \nL13: Sunan an-Nasa'i\nL14: \nL15: Sunan Abi 